    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game where you must endure the terror of the approaching cockroaches. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive until the end!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~Background of the story~ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been called in as a test subject to a mysterious research facility, and will be forced to endure a terrifying experience. It seems that no one has been able to endure until the end yet...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Just endure the fear of the approaching cockroaches</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Cockroaches attack in several different patterns. Can you withstand them all? (There are three patterns that occur during one game)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Single player. Play with others and compete for the highest score!</p>",
